### =========================
### CAKE APIs
### =========================

### All cake list API
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/

### Create a cake
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/
#Authorization: Token ccf14c25dbde03603412c63ca24e6f6cd2ab9204
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkzNjkzMTM0LCJpYXQiOjE3OTM2OTI4MzQsImp0aSI6IjE4NmFhNDM5MTdlODQyNWM5NGY4MTUxYTdlMGI2MzFlIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.HmawJXjXYfedbYDIgNERFbe4VPZMxaAmoaWu73baP8s
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=abc

--abc
