1
--abc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

1500
--abc--


### Retrieve all cakes
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/


### Update a cake
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/1/
Authorization: Token <YOUR_TOKEN>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=abc

--abc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Chocolate Vancho
--abc--


### Delete a cake
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/1/
Authorization: Token <YOUR_TOKEN>


### =========================
### CATEGORY APIs
### =========================

### All category list
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/category/


### Create a category
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/category/
Authorization: Basic <BASE64_USERNAME_PASSWORD>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=abc

--abc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Normal Cakes
--abc--


### Retrieve a category
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/category/1/


### Update a category
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/category/1/
Authorization: Basic <BASE64_USERNAME_PASSWORD>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=abc

--abc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Party Cakes
--abc--


### Delete a category
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/category/1/
Authorization: Basic <BASE64_USERNAME_PASSWORD>


### =========================
### SHAPE APIs
