### =========================
### WEIGHT APIs
### =========================

### All weight list
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/weight/


### Create a weight
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/weight/
Authorization: Basic <BASE64_USERNAME_PASSWORD>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=abc

--abc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

1kg
--abc--


### Retrieve a weight
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/weight/1/


### Update a weight
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/weight/1/
Authorization: Basic <BASE64_USERNAME_PASSWORD>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=abc

--abc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Half Kg
--abc--


### Delete a weight
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/weight/1/
Authorization: Basic <BASE64_USERNAME_PASSWORD>


